OL,3,ATrump says he would back ban on diesel
OL,4,Aexports
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,Fwould back proposals to halt American
OL,8,Fdiesel exports in a bid to ease prices
OL,9,Ffor drivers at the pumps.
OL,11,FHis comments come after Republicans
OL,12,Flawmakers put pressure on the president
OL,13,Fahead of November's mid-term elections
OL,14,Fto curb exports, as diesel prices soar
OL,15,Fto record highs in the US.
OL,17,FSpeaking on the sidelines at the United
OL,18,FNations General Assembly, Trump
OL,19,Fsuggested keeping domestic supplies
OL,20,Finside the US could also ease broader
OL,21,Fpetrol prices.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
