OL,3,ATrump says he would back ban on diesel
OL,4,Aexports
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've called for that too. I've said
OL,7,Flet's not send out the diesel. We make
OL,8,Fa lot of diesel. That could have a
OL,9,Flittle bit of an effect on regular
OL,10,Fautomobile gasoline," he said.
